  "2026-10-05T05:56:41.997Z",codex-sol,"Verified the shared 17 command/transport tests within the 86-test all-source suite: real TypeSafe SDK HTTP, host extension harness, and isolated real pm projects. All source coverage dimensions are 100%; live local tev1 schema/plausibility and packed npm/Bun installation acceptance passed. Implementation and receipts are linked in README.md and docs/v0-validation.md. Leaving this item in progress for orchestrator verification and closure."
  "2026-10-11T05:15:59.839Z",codex-sol,"Acceptance met on main 7c0f0e0: index.ts:1158 rankDedupeCandidates deterministically ranks complete SDK metadata and bounds candidates; index.ts:1182 runDedupeCommand asks one candidate-or-none choice and skips inference for an empty candidate set. Tests: ask, dedupe, gate and discovery dispatch on a real temporary tracker (test/decisions.test.ts:88); none is a real model option and hosted discovery failures have no native fallback (test/transport.test.ts:103). Duplicate decisions preserve successful exits while transport failures remain errors. Fresh main acceptance: node --test test/agent-ux.test.ts test/decisions.test.ts test/transport.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/calibration.test.ts passed 51/51, zero failures/skips. Tracker schema has no review status, so status stays in_progress; not closed. Cross-reference docs/tracker-reconciliation.md; line numbers refer to checked main."
